# build output
bin/
obj/
out/
publish/
dist/

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs

# rider / resharper
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

# os cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# local app data (tomoru writes its json to the OS app-data folder, not the repo,
# but ignore any stray copies dropped in the working tree)
*.tomoru.json
# Running the app from the repo without XDG_CONFIG_HOME set drops a whole
# profile directory here — state, decks and crash logs. The pattern above only
# catches loose json files, not the folder they usually arrive in.
/Tomoru/
# The old name's folder is still out there — on this machine, and on anyone's
# who ran a build from before the rename. The ignore rule got renamed along
# with everything else, which un-protected it, and a profile and two crash
# logs went into a commit before that was noticed. Both names stay ignored.
/Tomoshibi/
